1
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,600
Zhijiang Capacity Infinite Technology (Zhejiang) Co., Ltd.
Zhejiang Yanhe Culture Technology Co., Ltd.

2
00:01:13,680 --> 00:01:16,410
Musician Han is absolutely the best in Fangzhou.

3
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:17,600
Bravo!

4
00:01:18,440 --> 00:01:19,039
That sounds so beautiful.

5
00:01:19,039 --> 00:01:21,500
He truly lives up to his name as Musician Han.

6
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,280
Who are you?

7
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:42,160
Tell us your name.

8
00:01:44,680 --> 00:01:46,140
From the Western Regions,

9
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:47,759
Ashina Xiao.

10
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:49,120
It's the Zither Demon of the Western Regions.

11
00:01:49,120 --> 00:01:51,039
I heard of him when I was trading there.

12
00:01:51,039 --> 00:01:51,880
Those who challenged him in zither playing

13
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:52,960
all met a bad end.

14
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,800
What do you want?

15
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:57,360
I came to Fangzhou for a three-day zither duel.

16
00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:59,479
If I successfully hold the ring after three days,

17
00:01:59,479 --> 00:02:01,880
the so-called grand zither music of Huaxia

18
00:02:02,520 --> 00:02:04,240
is nothing but a piece of trash

19
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:05,880
on the road to the Western Regions.

20
00:02:05,880 --> 00:02:07,520
This is going too far!

21
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:09,560
I'll smash your arena right now!

22
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:10,280
Yeah!

23
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:56,120
My head hurts so much.

24
00:02:58,160 --> 00:02:58,680
Musician Han,

25
00:02:58,680 --> 00:02:59,880
my head hurts so much.

26
00:03:04,360 --> 00:03:05,620
What's wrong with you?

27
00:03:09,080 --> 00:03:11,120
Musician Han!

28
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:17,600
Is he... is he dead?

29
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:18,760
Brother Chu,

30
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,040
do you like it?

31
00:03:25,960 --> 00:03:26,840
Three days.

32
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:30,050
I'll be waiting for you.

33
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,400
What is his name again?

34
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,280
Ashina Xiao.

35
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:34,360
Hurry and report it to the yamen!

36
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:39,680
Last night,

37
00:03:40,120 --> 00:03:42,560
our famous Fangzhou zither player, Han Se...

38
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:47,160
Died competing in a zither battle with the Western Regions zitherist Ashina Xiao.

39
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,960
That Ashina Xiao even said

40
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:53,090
our Hua Xia zither music isn't worth a single hair of the Western Regions'.

41
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:56,560
Can we tolerate this?

42
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,280
If he has the guts, compete in swordplay.

43
00:03:59,280 --> 00:04:01,010
I'll chop him into minced meat.

44
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:02,120
They challenge you to a zither battle,

45
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,180
and you use a sword.

46
00:04:03,280 --> 00:04:04,740
Isn't that embarrassing?

47
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:08,400
Can a zither battle really kill someone?

48
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,080
I've heard something about it.

49
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:10,740
This person

50
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,680
is known as the Zither Demon of the Western Regions,

51
00:04:12,680 --> 00:04:14,840
and the human bone zither he uses is even more sinister.

52
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:17,600
I heard Musician Han died a gruesome death.

53
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,560
It must be the work of evil forces again.

54
00:04:20,560 --> 00:04:22,160
Investigate this case thoroughly.

55
00:04:22,160 --> 00:04:24,360
How can we let a lowly zitherist

56
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:27,220
be so arrogant within the borders of our Great Tang?

57
00:04:27,360 --> 00:04:28,160
Yes.

58
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:29,840
Wangzhou is established under Xishi.

59
00:04:29,840 --> 00:04:31,100
I heard about this man.

60
00:04:37,159 --> 00:04:38,400
He challenged others to a zither competition for three days,

61
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:40,240
and even wanted Prince Ling to announce it to the world.

62
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:42,560
Where does this kid from the Western Regions get the nerve?

63
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,360
I heard he just

64
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:45,240
competed with the best musician in Fangzhou and killed him.

65
00:04:45,240 --> 00:04:45,920
Yeah.

66
00:04:46,240 --> 00:04:47,370
His head split open.

67
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:48,360
I'm confused.

68
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,720
This isn't a zither competition.

69
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,980
It's clearly a murder.

70
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,640
You are Ashina Xiao?

71
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,120
I'm Su Yao from the county office.

72
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,580
Come with me to the office.

73
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:10,000
What if I don't go?

74
00:05:22,080 --> 00:05:25,080
This zither sound can indeed capture people's souls.

75
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:31,680
I want to see

76
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:34,480
if his zither is fiercer or my sword is faster.

77
00:05:36,840 --> 00:05:38,700
I'm Su Yao from the county office.

78
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,120
Come with me to the office.

79
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:42,560
Those who don't leave after hearing my zither

80
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:43,820
are not simple people.

81
00:05:43,880 --> 00:05:44,920
If I'm not wrong,

82
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,800
you two must be the famous detective Su

83
00:05:48,440 --> 00:05:49,680
and Mr. Shen from Fangzhou.

84
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:51,800
I heard your zither sound can kill.

85
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:55,920
Have you ever heard that a zither sound can kill?

86
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:58,200
It's clearly because your Tang musicians are not skilled enough,

87
00:05:58,200 --> 00:05:59,320
and died of shame.

88
00:05:59,760 --> 00:06:01,440
Don't falsely accuse me of murder.

89
00:06:01,440 --> 00:06:01,800
You!

90
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:02,570
Wait.

91
00:06:04,680 --> 00:06:06,240
Aren't there still two days left?

92
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,200
When the time comes,

93
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:08,880
someone will naturally deal with you.

94
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:11,080
You'd better not let us catch any flaws.

95
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:12,770
Let's go.

96
00:06:13,880 --> 00:06:14,880
Stop listening.

97
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:15,760
Go home.

98
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:17,320
Go home.

99
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:31,640
Master.

100
00:06:32,640 --> 00:06:33,960
Why did you leave?

101
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:36,080
I am unfilial.

102
00:06:36,880 --> 00:06:38,320
I watched you

103
00:06:38,520 --> 00:06:41,640
being killed by that demon from the Western Regions.

104
00:06:42,080 --> 00:06:43,280
Don't worry, Master.

105
00:06:44,159 --> 00:06:46,280
I will definitely avenge you.

106
00:06:46,840 --> 00:06:48,159
I will make Ashina Xiao

107
00:06:48,720 --> 00:06:50,080
be buried with you.

108
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:51,520
That sounds nice.

109
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:53,720
That zither demon is in the market.

110
00:06:53,720 --> 00:06:55,380
Why didn't you challenge him?

111
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,080
Qingluan.

112
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:00,970
What do you mean?

113
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,490
As the eldest disciple,

114
00:07:02,600 --> 00:07:04,130
I should bury Master first.

115
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,200
Even Master couldn't defeat that zither demon.

116
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:08,000
You going there is just a suicide.

117
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:08,680
You!

118
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,400
You've always been disrespectful to your elders.

119
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,040
They say the eldest brother is like a father.

120
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:14,920
Since Master is not here today,

121
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:17,160
I will teach you a lesson for him.

122
00:07:17,160 --> 00:07:19,690
What kind of eldest disciple are you? Come on!

123
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:20,520
Brothers.

124
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,380
Brothers, stop fighting.

125
00:07:22,960 --> 00:07:23,960
Stop it.

126
00:07:25,080 --> 00:07:25,880
Don't pull me.

127
00:07:26,400 --> 00:07:27,860
Brothers, stop fighting.

128
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:29,280
What's the noise?

129
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,160
Brothers,

130
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,480
stop fighting.

131
00:07:35,960 --> 00:07:37,620
Master's body is not yet cold.

132
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,320
You are fighting here.

133
00:07:39,320 --> 00:07:40,320
What a scandal!

134
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,760
Lord Su,

135
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,960
why are you here?

136
00:07:43,240 --> 00:07:45,800
Master Han was the best musician in Fangzhou.

137
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,440
He competed with Ashina Xiao this time.

138
00:07:48,920 --> 00:07:50,360
His death was suspicious.

139
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,680
So we're here to investigate.

140
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:52,480
Constable Su,

141
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,120
this is an internal matter of the Music Academy.

142
00:07:55,120 --> 00:07:56,450
We don't need your help.

143
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:58,680
How can you let our master die in vain?

144
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,280
It's not your place to speak!

145
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:04,780
The day Master Han died suddenly,

146
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:06,080
someone

147
00:08:06,680 --> 00:08:09,880
heard Ashina Xiao shout Chu Feng's name.

148
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,240
Who is Chu Feng?

149
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:20,080
He is our junior brother.

150
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,440
Ten years ago,

151
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:24,200
he was also the best musician in Fangzhou.

152
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:27,880
But he was also the most arrogant and insane musician.

153
00:08:30,560 --> 00:08:31,320
So handsome.

154
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,200
Chu Feng,

155
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,890
you took all the scores.

156
00:08:34,919 --> 00:08:36,320
What are we going to play?

157
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,049
You don't deserve to practice.

158
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:39,799
Get out of here!

159
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:44,720
Bravo!

160
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:49,570
He wouldn't board the emperor's boat,

161
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:52,720
calling himself an immortal of wine.

162
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,440
Bravo!

163
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:56,800
Bravo!

164
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:57,800
Amazing!

165
00:08:57,800 --> 00:08:58,200
Bravo!

166
00:09:08,680 --> 00:09:10,200
Junior Brother Chu Feng,

167
00:09:11,200 --> 00:09:13,960
why did you take things so hard?

168
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:19,520
The world has lost its music.

169
00:09:19,680 --> 00:09:21,080
The way of the qin is dead.

170
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,820
He committed suicide.

171
00:09:24,920 --> 00:09:25,920
Yes.

172
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,560
He was like Dugu Qiubai.

173
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:30,330
He could never find a rival,

174
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,980
and felt extremely empty.

175
00:09:32,520 --> 00:09:34,250
He became possessed by the qin.

176
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:34,920
Tell me,

177
00:09:35,680 --> 00:09:37,360
isn't it a pity?

178
00:09:37,560 --> 00:09:38,680
If Chu Feng were here.

179
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:41,320
How dare you let this scoundrel from the Western Regions be so arrogant!

180
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,960
You have to be obsessed to succeed.

181
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:45,200
Junior Brother Chu Feng had slender fingers,

182
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:46,400
sharp ears, and keen eyes.

183
00:09:46,400 --> 00:09:48,730
He was truly a rare and talented lutenist.

184
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:49,720
What a pity.

185
00:09:49,920 --> 00:09:51,520
He acted domineering and unrestrained,

186
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:53,040
which eventually backfired

187
00:09:53,040 --> 00:09:54,520
and caused a tragedy.

188
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,890
Who is playing the lute?

189
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:13,440
Master.

190
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,080
A zombie!

191
00:10:25,160 --> 00:10:25,960
Pull me!

192
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:30,680
Close it!

193
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,080
Yes.

194
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:36,920
Push harder!

195
00:10:42,440 --> 00:10:44,560
The lute music. It's the lute music.

196
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,000
Push harder!

197
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:53,520
Stop!

198
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,800
I told you to stop playing!
